# Module
Module194281Name = Variable BOM
Module194281Desc = One BOM for all the variants of a product, resolved for each variant to produce
VariableBom = Variable BOM
VariableBomSetup = Variable BOM setup
VariableBomSetupDesc = A variable BOM is a BOM of a parent product with variants. Its lines flagged "Matched to variant" use a parent product with variants, and the variant consumed is resolved from the variant to produce.
VariableBomTab = Variants
VariableBomSuffix = (Variable BOM)

# Core hook
VariableBomCoreHook = Hook processBOMLines of Dolibarr core
VariableBomCoreHookOk = Available
VariableBomCoreHookDesc = Needed to resolve the lines of a manufacturing order. Proposed to Dolibarr; until it is merged, apply the patch provided with the module (core-patch directory).
ErrorVariableBomCoreHookMissing = Your Dolibarr version does not have the hook processBOMLines needed by the Variable BOM module: manufacturing orders of variable BOMs are refused. Apply the core patch provided with the module.

# BOM
VariableBomNbVariants = Yes, for %s variants
VariableBomNotVariable = This BOM is not a variable BOM: its product to produce has no variants.
VariableBomLineMatch = Matched to variant
VariableBomLineMatchHelp = The product of the line is a parent product with variants. When a manufacturing order is created, the variant consumed is the one having the same attribute values as the variant to produce (or the fixed values defined in the variant rules of the line).
VariableBomLines = Lines of the BOM (for %s variants to produce)
VariableBomRules = Variant rules
VariableBomRulesOfLine = Variant rules of line
VariableBomRulesSaved = Variant rules saved
VariableBomResolution = Resolution
VariableBomResolvedCount = Resolved for %s of %s variants
VariableBomComponentAttributes = Attributes of the component
VariableBomComponentAttributesHelp = For each attribute of the component, choose whether its value follows the variant to produce or is always the same value.
VariableBomSameAsProduced = Same as variant to produce
VariableBomChooseValue = Choose a value (attribute not on the product to produce)
VariableBomQtyByVariant = Quantity by variant
VariableBomQtyAttribute = Quantity varies by
VariableBomQtyNone = Same quantity for all variants
VariableBomQtyHelp = Leave empty to use the quantity of the line (%s). Use 0 if the line is not used for this value.
VariableBomQtySummary = Qty by %s: %s
VariableBomPreview = Result for each variant to produce
VariableBomNotUsed = Not used

# MO
VariableBomVariantToProduce = Variant to produce
VariableBomSelectVariant = Select the variant to produce to see the components that will be consumed.

# Errors
ErrorVariableBomMatchNeedsVariableBom = A line can be matched to variant only if the product to produce of the BOM has variants.
ErrorVariableBomMatchNeedsVariantParent = A line can be matched to variant only if its product is a parent product with variants.
ErrorVariableBomVariantToProduceRequired = This BOM is a variable BOM: the product to produce must be a variant of %s.
ErrorVariableBomAttributeNotDefined = Component %s: no value for attribute(s) %s. Set a fixed value in the variant rules of the line.
ErrorVariableBomNoVariantFound = Component %s: no variant exists for %s.
ErrorVariableBomNoVariantForValues = No variant of %s exists for the selected values.

# Debug
DebugMode = Debug Mode
DebugModeDesc = When enabled, exposes a diagnostic endpoint at /custom/variablebom/ajax/debug.php for troubleshooting (module status, core hook, resolution of a BOM).
